Package: sciSpatialR
Title: Spatial Data Harmonisation and Covariate Extraction for Alberta Biodiversity Projects
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Brendan", "Casey", email = "brendan.casey@ualberta.ca",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools for harmonising spatial layers (masking,
    resampling, aggregating) and extracting covariates at point
    locations for Alberta-focused biodiversity and species distribution
    modelling workflows.  Functions cover input validation, CRS
    harmonisation, harmonisation to a reference grid, point-in-cell and
    buffer-based extraction, and a catalogue layer for discovering and
    retrieving canonical spatial layers.
